<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, shrink-to-fit=no">
    <title><%= title %> - Admin Panel</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/assets/img/favicon.png?v=4">
    <link href="/assets/vendor/fontawesome-free/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">    <link href="/assets/css/sb-admin-2.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body id="page-top">
    <div id="wrapper">
        <%- include('../partials/sidebar') %>
        <div id="content-wrapper" class="d-flex flex-column">
            <div id="content">
                <%- include('../partials/topbar', { user }) %>
                <div class="container-fluid">
                    <div class="d-sm-flex align-items-center justify-content-between mb-4">
                        <h1 class="h3 mb-0 text-gray-800">Tambah Slider</h1>
                        <a href="/admin/slider" class="d-none d-sm-inline-block btn btn-sm btn-secondary shadow-sm">
                            <i class="fas fa-arrow-left fa-sm text-white-50"></i> Kembali
                        </a>
                    </div>

                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-lg-8">
                            <div class="card shadow mb-4">
                                <div class="card-header py-3">
                                    <h6 class="m-0 font-weight-bold text-primary">Form Tambah Slider</h6>
                                </div>
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <form method="POST" action="/admin/slider/create" enctype="multipart/form-data">
        <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
                                        <div class="form-group">
                                            <label for="judul">Judul *</label>
                                            <input type="text" class="form-control" id="judul" name="judul" required>
                                        </div>
                                        
                                        <div class="form-group">
                                            <label for="subjudul">Subjudul</label>
                                            <input type="text" class="form-control" id="subjudul" name="subjudul">
                                        </div>
                                        
                                        <div class="form-group">
                                            <label for="deskripsi">Deskripsi</label>
                                            <textarea class="form-control" id="deskripsi" name="deskripsi" rows="3"></textarea>
                                        </div>
                                        
                                        <div class="form-group">
                                            <label for="gambar">Gambar Slider *</label>
                                            <input type="file" class="form-control-file" id="gambar" name="gambar" accept="image/*" required>
                                            <small class="form-text text-muted">
                                                Format: JPG/PNG. Maks 10MB.
                                                <strong class="text-danger">Ukuran ideal: 1920 x 860 px</strong>
                                                (lebar penuh, tinggi disesuaikan tampilan layar)
                                            </small>
                                        </div>
                                        
                                        <div class="form-group">
                                            <label for="link_url">URL Link (opsional)</label>
                                            <input type="url" class="form-control" id="link_url" name="link_url" placeholder="https://example.com">
                                        </div>
                                        
                                        <div class="form-group">
                                            <label for="link_text">Teks Link (opsional)</label>
                                            <input type="text" class="form-control" id="link_text" name="link_text" placeholder="Pelajari Lebih Lanjut">
                                        </div>
                                        
                                        <div class="form-group">
                                            <label for="urutan">Urutan</label>
                                            <input type="number" class="form-control" id="urutan" name="urutan" value="0" min="0">
                                            <small class="form-text text-muted">Semakin kecil angka, semakin awal ditampilkan</small>
                                        </div>
                                        
                                        <div class="form-group">
                                            <label for="status">Status</label>
                                            <select class="form-control" id="status" name="status">
                                                <option value="aktif">Aktif</option>
                                                <option value="nonaktif">Non-aktif</option>
                                            </select>
                                        </div>
                                        
                                        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Simpan</button>
                                        <a href="/admin/slider" class="btn btn-secondary">Batal</a>
                                    </form>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="col-lg-4">
                            <div class="card shadow mb-4">
                                <div class="card-header py-3">
                                    <h6 class="m-0 font-weight-bold text-primary">Panduan</h6>
                                </div>
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <div class="alert alert-info py-2 px-3 mb-3" style="border-left:4px solid #17a2b8;">
                                        <i class="fas fa-ruler-combined mr-1"></i>
                                        <strong>Ukuran Gambar Slider yang Ideal:</strong>
                                        <div class="mt-2">
                                            <span class="badge badge-success">✓ 1920 x 860 px</span>
                                            <span class="badge badge-success ml-1">✓ 1600 x 720 px</span>
                                            <span class="badge badge-success ml-1">✓ 1280 x 575 px</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <small class="d-block mt-2 text-muted">Rasio lebar:tinggi ≈ <strong>2.23 : 1</strong> (lebih lebar dari 16:9 biasa)</small>
                                        <hr class="my-2">
                                        <small>
                                            <i class="fas fa-info-circle text-info mr-1"></i>
                                            Slider mengisi <strong>tinggi layar penuh</strong> dikurangi navbar (~56px) dan ticker (~44px).
                                            Di layar <strong>768px</strong> tinggi → slider ≈ <strong>668px</strong>.
                                            Di layar <strong>1080px</strong> tinggi → slider ≈ <strong>860px</strong> (maks).
                                        </small>
                                        <div class="mt-2">
                                            <small class="text-danger"><i class="fas fa-times mr-1"></i>Hindari rasio 1:1, 4:3, atau 16:9 — akan tampil terpotong atas-bawah.</small>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <h6>Tips Lainnya:</h6>
                                    <ul class="small">
                                        <li>Format <strong>JPG</strong> lebih ringan dari PNG untuk foto</li>
                                        <li>Pastikan subjek utama berada di <strong>tengah atau kiri</strong> gambar</li>
                                        <li>Hindari teks penting di tepi gambar (bisa terpotong di layar kecil)</li>
                                        <li>Judul singkat, deskripsi maksimal 2-3 kalimat</li>
                                        <li>Angka urutan kecil = tampil lebih awal</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <%- include('../partials/footer') %>
        </div>
    </div>
    <a class="scroll-to-top rounded" href="#page-top">
        <i class="fas fa-angle-up"></i>
    </a>
    <script src="/assets/vendor/jquery/jquery.min.js"></script>
    <script src="/assets/vendor/bootstrap/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
    <script src="/assets/vendor/jquery-easing/jquery.easing.min.js"></script>
    <script src="/assets/js/sb-admin-2.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>